OL,3,ABond producer first female president of
OL,4,Afilm school
OL,5,
OL,6,FPuttnam, whose credits include Chariots
OL,7,Fof Fire, The Killing Fields and
OL,8,FMidnight Express, said he was "over the
OL,9,Fmoon" that such a "hugely respected
OL,10,Ffigure" was succeeding him.
